OL,3,APetrol and diesel price rises push UK
OL,4,Ainflation higher
OL,5,
OL,6,FRises in petrol, diesel and airfares
OL,7,Fpushed UK inflation up to its highest
OL,8,Flevel in five months in the year to
OL,9,FAugust.
OL,11,FInflation accelerated to 3.1% from
OL,12,F2.9%, according to the Office for
OL,13,FNational Statistics (ONS).
OL,15,FThe cost of filling up a vehicle soared
OL,16,Fin August as the conflict in the Middle
OL,17,FEast continued to disrupt global oil
OL,18,Fsupplies. Petrol prices jumped to their
OL,19,Fhighest for nearly four years, the ONS
OL,20,Fsaid, while diesel also rocketed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
